                                    <button type="button" class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold bg-lime-500/10 hover:bg-lime-500/20 text-lime-600 dark:text-lime-400 border border-lime-500/25 cursor-pointer transition">Download</button>
